# L §5.3: "assumed STR marks the whole version ... Every row of it ... puts the reason in the register of each
# result that reads it (§8.2)."  L §8.2: "assumed: <reason> ... once, with the keys it filled".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2016-03-01
  start 2015-11-01
  end 2016-10-31

source s "s"

input n: int

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2016-01-01
  assumed "a 2022 text read for 2016"
  n = 1

ask q1: n
=== expect
q1: 1
  assumed: a 2022 text read for 2016 (n)
  cut 2016-03-01
